Yhat is predicted value of Y
OLS fitted value Y1= Bhat0+Bhat1*X1 is the models prediction of Y at X
Residual=actual value-predicted value or Uhat1=Yi-Yhati
Residual=Reality-Regression Prediction
a positive residual means Residual=actual-predicted is >0 this is an underprediction
actual-predicted<0 overpredicted 
Total=explained+unexplained or SST=SSE+SSR
The sum of OLS residuals always is equal to 0
R^2 is how much variation of Y is explained by X, closer to 1 more of Ys variation explained by X, 0 less explained
R^2=SSR/SST
